      {
        "id": 234096,
        "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-28T19:35:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Near Mint after an ouchy first game and a rewind to save the second.<br>\n<br>\nNote to self/others: Kismet damaging the Talisman while in a hero play area and bringing it to 0 counts for her \"Play a card when something is destroyed\", which means she plays a card with the Talisman in her play area, which means major ouch. If I didn't interrupt her chain of plays from destroying first the Talisman then devices to pick a different target for one of her damage instances, I would have lost the second game as well. As it was, Regression turret and Leader of the Pack kept things from dying once I picked the right target order and the heroes won with ~10 hp left.</p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:05.878Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
