        "raw": "<p>Near Mint after an ouchy first game and a rewind to save the second.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote to self/others: Kismet damaging the Talisman while in a hero play area and bringing it to 0 counts for her \"Play a card when something is destroyed\", which means she plays a card with the Talisman in her play area, which means major ouch. If I didn't interrupt her chain of plays from destroying first the Talisman then devices to pick a different target for one of her damage instances, I would have lost the second game as well. As it was, Regression turret and Leader of the Pack kept things from dying once I picked the right target order and the heroes won with ~10 hp left.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
