        "id": 234097,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-29T22:56:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The first time I played I got destroyed; Kismet blasted a device, chain-played four Jinxes, blew up three more devices, and things went to hell in a handbasket so fast.</p>\n<p>The second time was going okay until the environment killed the talisman, flipped it over to Kismet, and then on her turn she played four Jinxes and hit everyone twice for 8 damage a pop and things fell apart pretty soon after that.</p>\n<p>The third game, Mainstay got Kismet in a Headlock right away, I got about ten devices out in a turn and a half and then swapped to Heroic Luminary, and Kismet was dead in about four turns with everyone at 15+ health.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So swingy.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
