        "created_at": "2020-10-29T22:59:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Third time was the charm! Never thought I'd use something like Leader of the Pack to save non-character targets. Really important to get One With the Land out, too, so Seeds can absorb environment damage before Kismet can get to them. :B</p>",
