        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-30T15:36:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My first try, I had her down to 1 hp at the beginning of her turn.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>She then proceeded to take out my entire team who were all at fairly high hp.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If I didn't have that -1 damage jinx on Luminary, I would have won when she popped the first device, because of All According to Plan.</p>",
